# Security headers Netlify adds to every response (HSTS is already added by Netlify itself).
#  - X-Frame-Options: stops other sites from embedding Forja in a hidden frame and tricking
#    someone into tapping buttons (like Delete Account) without realizing it.
#  - X-Content-Type-Options: browsers must not guess file types (blocks a class of script tricks).
#  - Referrer-Policy: other sites only learn the domain a visitor came from, never full app URLs.
#  - Permissions-Policy: only Forja itself may ask for the camera and location; nothing it loads
#    from elsewhere can, and features the app never uses are switched off entirely.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), geolocation=(self), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()